{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:18:197","content":{"id":197,"title":"第十七课：材质与外观","content":[{"children":[{"text":"材质的外观，有不同的材质，在光照下表现出不同的外观，外观是材质和光照作用的结果","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4d663cef-34db-455e-9c11-d71f9fd58e89","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dfb3f8d5-15a6-4ea7-a686-659fcdca9535","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_63531c4e-0b3f-4680-ba79-a12da197ea6f.png"},{"children":[{"text":"在图形学中，什么是材质？渲染方程中哪一项是和材质有关的呢？BRDF，材质 = BRDF。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e015fcd0-199f-424f-9bbf-9989eaf90448","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bc7aae49-74f3-4513-9030-1e617aafb546","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_30fa5920-9d49-4057-a40a-21dc826a4846.png"},{"children":[{"text":"漫反射材质","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"352611a2-ae56-4e01-b814-508dd609a948","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"468ababe-dbd1-463e-ba78-dda5dbf5b4a8","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_055e3011-2d6c-48d0-8d6c-4fc39c2d308d.png"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8418db13-6599-4679-9437-e7bc601c1a8e","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ca8e9b36-b583-458c-a529-e98609b4421c.png"},{"children":[{"text":"漫反射材质的漫反射系数，假设入射光是常数，考虑能量守恒， ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"L_i = L_o","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"be480ccf-dccd-47be-829b-96a0950c0267","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"L_i = L_o","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"262f9c6e-1122-44b1-be07-378bc71b29e9","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"定义反射率 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\rho","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"20ecf844-0f2e-42a4-90f7-414efe67ec67","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\rho \\in [0, 1]","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a0a66d95-d442-49e9-af4a-27c737023108","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f13a8900-9c01-4eee-9661-de05145209b3","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_af25f29c-c9fe-44d2-96d0-9a4e77255e0b.png"},{"children":[{"text":"Glossy 反射，抛光的金属","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fb805483-db28-4a75-b12c-70117e6e1135","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bf919cd7-8ebb-4cb4-a2b7-e06dd0aa38f7","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_55b7f906-0c0e-45d3-a8e3-b99a520cf446.png"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"456d193a-4089-4be1-8b99-5d6c399089b9","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f0864