oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b622a5e5-a1e0-4e3d-af29-45b482fce566.png"},{"children":[{"text":"Snell's Law，斯涅尔定律","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2b049af2-5b45-4be7-82e5-5c2411982289","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a985a23c-36ae-4461-b4c1-f49fca97eee1","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6e467271-d5eb-4506-a631-1a6ba1dda4aa.png"},{"children":[{"text":"折射定律，如果得不到有意义的实数，折射就不可能发生，全反射，要求 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\frac{\\_eta_i}{\\eta_t} > 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d0b7f7e1-e01b-4819-8f32-434ad2db1d01","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\dfrac{\\eta_i}{\\eta_t} > 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，入射的介质比折射的介质更密时才有可能发生。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b57cefb7-72ed-4fa8-bafa-5867c30dcd48","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"折射对应的 BRTF，和 BRDF 统称 BSDF。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6a34097a-1a7b-44aa-91ca-63d6184c6f9c","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c89dcea8-5dac-4d71-b967-1dd65e00c25f","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_89736312-4cad-4be6-87cb-a446066a856b.png"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2f965d0b-91f9-4db0-bc52-4adc6946c25a","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_497c7d2a-7744-40e8-9686-051968903c33.png"},{"children":[{"text":"菲涅耳项，不同的视角看过去，有个神奇的问题，垂直的往下看，几乎看不到什么反射，平看，桌子反射书特别明显，有多少光反射，和入射光的角度有关的，通过菲涅耳项可以知道多少发生了反射，多少发生了折射","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e172e44b-0978-4d9d-a586-1fa1effd8037","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ea66135c-3a1d-4ff1-8ee5-daa94d9d3d3a","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c18f2b62-2b2c-4b39-934f-6ae928ff3ad8.png"},{"children":[{"text":"举个例子，如果垂直窗子看，可以看到外面，没问题，如果你看前面几排人的窗户，几乎和窗子平行，看到的都是反射","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bf63d572-9cac-488c-b307-8bdfe60a7f61","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f3f3cf4-322b-43f4-ab1f-accf32c9c802","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3e5131d5-13ab-4ab8-b2b4-30847c9cc732.png"},{"children":[{"text":"金属的菲涅耳项","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dc400cdd-b495-454f-b5e2-1bcf03334021","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"312b6832-2b56-49b3-a987-30332133e12d","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b57acd0a-68fa-47ed-b2ee-b73b6c173fcc.png"},{"children":[{"text":"菲涅耳项的计算，算起来很麻烦，有一个 Schlick's 的近似算法，拟合的一条曲线，在图形学得到的广泛的应用，只要对材质的要求特别高，是一个很好的近似","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c5bb01a1-3252-4cf1-9664-d012db1b142e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d363b415-2766-407f-aa4d-1c714c7ab96b","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_392ba141-d318-4742-bc75-8396a1df4cee.png"},{"children":[{"text":"真正的基于物体的材质，微表面材质。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"197d2deb-80de-41f7-800b-26ec7a444ebf","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"地球的山、树什么都看不到，说明从远处看看不到细节，微表面模型，基于这种假设，如果离得远，很多东西看不到，看到的是总体的一个效应","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"840da704-6255-4769-9473-bbb17e4fcc18","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4314bc37-a654-40e7-bca1-58d9c48665bf","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_69ca6638-91dd-4186-a927-6acdd7f33319.png"},{"children":[{"text":"表面是粗糙的，从远处看，东西是平的，看到的是外观，从近处看，可以看到微表面的细节，看到的是材质，每个微表面都认为是镜面反射","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0c0b947d-de21-4162-88e9-6f5309db12cc","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"39e08f1b-7bc1-4395-9998-c10b27f81925","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a74ff893-0167-4934-8476-eb5e77bf62d8.png"},{"children":[{"text":"微表面法线形成的一个分布，微表面的粗糙程度使用法线分布表示","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43afe632-9939-4a97-be1a-6d3fbdcaf621","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"061f425f-581d-4979-a88a-79ebf4f46a37","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_956d22f7-d305-4b05-ad40-d07a3a3cd7c6.png"},{"children":[{"text":"微表面之间的互相遮挡，比如光线几乎和面平着进来，G 就是用来修正这个","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"84659736-4266-4004-af30-899aefc8a1c4","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"010b2a70-2fda-4c77-80c6-ec61e5fb90d9","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d6a089bf-3956-4013-a50a-7227b65c3f5f.png"},{"children":[{"text":"微表面模型的例子","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"40226115-7f4d-403c-ae9a-71088b987a3a","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"30203e09-67e1-451e-9fe5-6fc479389954","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1bc92d83-60e1-447d-a511-40a437bcc589.png"},{"children":[{"text":"区分材质的方式。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"28245370-3af0-49b0-b4e1-086c9b2620cb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这个图是电梯间的内部，电梯间四面八方都是金属，金属是平面，头顶有些小灯，打到金属表现，会形成高光，形成的高光不应该是椭圆吗，怎么看到是这种东西，仔细看材质的话，有一个问题，是被磨过的的金属，这种情况会造成奇怪的高光，这个怎么回事，区分材质一类的方法：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"acf8f676-6698-4e04-b8ad-c27e71b16bca","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"各项同性材质","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8764c202-d250-46c9-ac3b-f17f12234763","tauContract":"f4b9b042